            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "hey its alyssa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I reduced the pineapple juice by about a tablespoon and added some pineapple puree. I made pineapple cupcakes with this frosting and a marichino cherry on top. It gave it a very \"classic cupcake\" look and tasted delicious. I made 24 of them and they were gone a day later. My family and friends gave so many compliments! Thanks for the recipe! I will be using it again! :)",
